{"title": "Burning Acid (Condition)", "pageid": 40201, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Burning_Acid_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Burning Acid</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The hatchery waters burn through all those who'd intrude upon it. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CRE_HATCHERY_ACIDPOOL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CRE_HATCHERY_ACIDPOOL+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CRE_HATCHERY_ACIDPOOL+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CAUSTIC_BRINE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCAUSTIC_BRINE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCAUSTIC_BRINE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Surface\" title=\"SG Surface\">SG_Surface</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>CAUSTIC_BRINE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Burning_Acid\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Acid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Burning Acid</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The hatchery waters burn through all those who'd intrude upon it.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Caustic_Brine\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Brine_(Condition)\" title=\"Caustic Brine (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Caustic Brine\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Brine_(Condition)\" title=\"Caustic Brine (Condition)\">Caustic Brine</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached t